  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lucelocelo pa bushiku bwakutampa umulungu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ubushiku bwakutampa mulungu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kuli ifwe epa mulungu, pa sondo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ninshi kuciliko akafifi, Maria Mandalena aile ku nindi. Amona nokuti icilibwe nabacifumyapo pa mwinshi wa nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe abwelelamo ulubilo kuli Simoni Petelo na ku musambi umbi ulya Yesu atemenwe. Abeba ati, “Nabafumya Imfumu mu nindi, tatwishibe noko baibikile!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Petelo no musambi umbi ulya baima, balaya ku nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balabutukilafye capamo. Lelo umusambi umbi ulya, acisha Petelo ulubilo abalilapo no kufika ku nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ati enaminemo, amona insalu shili panshi. Nomba taingilemo iyoo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoni Petelo uwalemukonka lutonuma, nao afika. Wena apopene aingila mu nindi. Amona ne nsalu shili panshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amona ne nsalu intu bapombele Yesu ku mutwe. Yena yali iyapetwa, tayali pamo ne nsalu shimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo umusambi umbi ulya abalilepo ukufika ku nindi, nao aingilamo. Ati amone ifi, asumina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu pali iyi nshita, ninshi tabalaumfwa umwalola ifyalembwa mu Malembo Yamushilo ukuti, “Kristu ali nokushukuka ku bafwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo aba basambi babwelelamo ku musumba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maria wena ninshi eminine kunse ya nindi, alelila. Ilyo acili alelila, ainama pakuti aloleshe mu nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe amonamo bamalaika babili bafwele insalu ishabuuta, bekele apo balalike icitumbi cakwa Yesu. Umo ku mitwe elyo umbi ku ntambalilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamalaika bamwipusha abati, “We mayo, cinshi ulelilila?” Nao abasuka ati, “Nabasenda Imfumu yandi, nshishibe noko baibikile!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Maria asosa ifi, apilibuka amona na Yesu naiminina. Nomba taishibe ukuti ni Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu amwipusha ati, “Mayo cinshi ulelilila? Bushe nani ulefwaya?” Maria ena ico aletontonkanya ati mulimi wa mwibala, amweba ati, “Mukwai nga nimwe mumusendele, njebeni uko mumubikile, na ine nalaya mubuula.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu elyo amwita ati, “Maria!” Maria nao apilibuka, amwasukila mu Cihibulu ati, “Raboni!” Ici calola mukuti, “Kafundisha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu amweba ati, “Leka ukunjikata, pantu nshilabwelelamo kuli Tata. Nomba kabiye kuli bamunyinane ubebe auti, Yesu aleti, ‘Nalabwelelamo kuli Tata, na imwe ni Shinwe, ni Lesa wandi, na imwe ni Lesa wenu.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maria Mandalena epakuya ku basambi. Alabeba ati, “Nimona Imfumu.” Elyo alabashimikila na fyonse ifyo Yesu amwebele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nshiku ya Mulungu ine iyo, icungulo bushiku, ku mulandu wakutiina Abayuda, abasambi balongene mu ŋanda nabesalako ne fiibi. Elyo Yesu aisa iminina apo bali, abeba ati, “Umutende ube na imwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ati asose ifi, elyo abalanga indupi shakwe na mu lubafu lwakwe. Awe abasambi basansamuka nganshi pakumona Imfumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abwekeshapo nakabili ukubeba ati, “Umutende ube na imwe! Filya Tata antuma, efyo na ine namutuma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ati asose ifi, abaputilisha umupu, abeba ati, “Pokeni Mupashi Wamushilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga mwabelela umuntu uluse ku fyabubifi fyakwe, ninshi nabelelwa uluse. Nga mwakaana ukubelela umuntu uluse ku fyabubifi fyakwe, ninshi tabelelwe luse.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toma umo pa basole ikumi na babili, uo baleti, Mpundu, wena talipo ilyo Yesu aishile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abasambi bambi balamushimikila abati, “Ifwe natumona Imfumu.” Lelo Toma abasuka ati, “Ine pakusumina kanofye namona ifibala fya nsunga mu ndupi shakwe, nashimpa no munwe wandi pa fibala, nabika ne minwe yandi mu lubafu lwakwe, nga teifyo ninshi nshasumine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pati papite umulungu umo, abasambi nakabili bali mu ŋanda, Toma nao lyena ali nabo pamo. Yesu aisamo ninshi ifiibi nafisalwa. Aiminina napo bali, asosa ati, “Umutende ube na imwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo aeba Toma ati, “Shimpa umunwe obe apa, lolesha na mu ndupi shandi. Buula iminwe yobe wikate na mu lubafu lwandi. Nomba leka ukutwishika, suminafye!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toma epakwasuka ati, “We Mfumu yandi, we Lesa wandi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu amweba ati, “Wasumina ico wamona. Ala abashuka ni abo bantu abasumina nelyo bashimwene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
